# Posting thread root <messageAlias> with text <baseText> in channel <channelAlias> for user <userAlias>
* Navigating to channel <channelAlias> for user <userAlias>
* generating net-new message details <messageAlias> with text <baseText> in channel <channelAlias> for user <userAlias>
* Sending stored message <messageAlias> in channel <channelAlias> for user <userAlias>

# Opening thread on stored message <messageAlias> in channel <channelAlias> for user <userAlias>
* clicking hover action "[data-testid='hover-action-reply-in-thread']" on stored user <userAlias> channel <channelAlias> message <messageAlias> in "[data-testid='chat-message-list']"
* waiting for "[data-testid='thread-panel'] [data-testid='message-input']" to appear

