* clicking on "[data-testid='hover-action-delete-message']"
* clicking on "[data-testid='confirm-delete-message']"
* waiting for zero sync to settle fast

# Closing thread panel
* clicking on "[data-testid='thread-panel'] button[aria-label='Close thread panel' i]"
* waiting for "[data-testid='thread-panel']" to disappear

# Opening threads page sorted by most recent
* navigating via sidebar to "chat"
* clicking on "[data-testid='open-threads-button']"
* clicking on "button[data-track-name='SORT_MOST_RECENT']"

# Attaching fixture file <fileName> to the open thread reply
* attaching fixture file <fileName> to "[data-testid='thread-panel'] input[type='file']"
* waiting for attachment <fileName> to finish uploading
